# vectors.bin is a raw little-endian Float32 matrix. Any line-ending conversion
# corrupts it silently — 0x0A bytes inside a float would become 0x0D0A on a
# Windows checkout and the matrix would be both wrong and the wrong length.
# loadIndex() does check byteLength against count*dims, so it would fail loudly
# rather than serve nonsense, but the deploy would simply be broken.
*.bin binary
data/index/*.json -text
